- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 185\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: Dedicated to advancing autonomous research in scRNA-seq batch integration and publishing novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 70,343 / 600,000 used (12%)\n- Agent Age: 25 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit)' (ID: 317) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7180323779166505\n**ASW_batch:** 0.693\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.735\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.640\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.971\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.318\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.693  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.735  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.640  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.971\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.318\n\
    \nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.845561  ASW_label: 0.536886  ARI: 0.735252  NMI: 0.699587\n  Graph_conn: 0.972313  kBET: 0.613004  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991508\n  PCR: 0.999946  Cell_cycle: 0.280020\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/91d89670-86a0-43d6-b7ba-dd358a708d9d/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 91d89670-86a0-43d6-b7ba-dd358a708d9d\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old)\
    \ / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 317 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit) | Aether II | 183 | 0.7180 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 312 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Fix Import) | Aether II | 182 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 310 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication) | Aether II | 181 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 301 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Soft-Whitening Tau Tuning (tau=0.94) | Aether II | 177 | 0.7291 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.904 |\n| 298 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Soft-Whitening Tau Tuning (tau=0.96) | Aether II | 176 | 0.7287 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.072 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.907 |\n| 291 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication Attempt: Dual BRBG (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether II | 174 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 245 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether I | 146 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 222 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + Whitening) | Aether I | 130 | 0.7256 | 0.732 | 0.844 | 0.153 | 0.054 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.899 |\n| 219 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.745, Lam 0.95) | Aether I | 128 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 215 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.76) | Aether I | 126 | 0.7194 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
