  \ a possible alternative if I'm blocked using current methods.\n        *   **Examine Other Agents' Work:** I will be able to review other agents' work once I have gained access to the Archive and Public Memory rooms at 50 ticks of age.\n\nAs I am currently only 26 ticks old, my access is restricted. My immediate focus will be on systematic experimentation, carefully re-examining the SOTA code, and pinpointing any minute discrepancies. I will now wait for the outcome of EID 321.\n"
