    \ | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 335 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection (BIVG) | Aether II | 190 | 0.7294 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.080 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.907 |\n| 338 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: BIVG + Fixed Random State for Neighbors | Aether II | 192 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.080 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 291 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication Attempt: Dual BRBG (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether II | 174 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 245 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether I | 146 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 301 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Soft-Whitening Tau Tuning (tau=0.94) | Aether II | 177 | 0.7291 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157\
    \ | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.904 |\n| 321 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: K-total Tuning (k_total=49) | Aether II | 185 | 0.7290 | 0.735 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.080 | 0.972 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.932 | 0.907 |\n| 298 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Soft-Whitening Tau Tuning (tau=0.96) | Aether II | 176 | 0.7287 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.072 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.907 |\n| 222 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + Whitening) | Aether I | 130 | 0.7256 | 0.732 | 0.844 | 0.153 | 0.054 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.899 |\n| 180 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization) | Aether I | 102 | 0.7199 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.971 | 0.695 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 192 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned) | Aether I | 111 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 211 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication\
    \ (Global Seed) | Aether I | 124 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 219 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.745, Lam 0.95) | Aether I | 128 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 205 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Final Import Fix) | Aether I | 119 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 215 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.76) | Aether I | 126 | 0.7194 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 167 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Import Fixed) | Aether I | 90 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 189 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + BIVG) | Aether I | 109 | 0.7181 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318\
    \ | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 317 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit) | Aether II | 183 | 0.7180 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 137 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Synthesis: Residualized PCA Emb & Balanced kNN Graph (SOTA Attempt) | Aether I | 69 | 0.7072 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.673 |\n| 128 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Hybrid: Residualized PCA Emb & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 66 | 0.7010 | 0.767 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.916 | 0.717 | 0.931 | 0.929 | 0.913 | 0.672 |\n| 69 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (Explicit Neighbors Meta) | Aether I | 32 | 0.6986 | 0.743 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.934 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.919 | 0.886 | 0.604 |\n| 91 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (No Trimming) | Aether I | 41 | 0.6984 | 0.743 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.934 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.919 | 0.885 | 0.603 |\n| 75 | 1 | Combat Embedding\
    \ & BBKNN Graph (K-Neighbors 5 Tuned) | Aether I | 34 | 0.6967 | 0.745 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.956 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.928 | 0.834 | 0.604 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 357 | 1 | Aether II Combat: Adaptive Batch-Specific Shrinkage (Factor 0.1) | Aether II | 201 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 351 | 1 | Aether II Combat Manual Baseline Replication | Aether II | 198 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 27 | 1 | Manual Combat Empirical Bayes Batch Integration | Aether I | 15 | 0.5893 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.601 |\n| 65 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (Dual Output Hybrid) | Aether I | 30 | 0.5893 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.601 |\n| 107 | 1 | Generalization:\
    \ Standard PCA Embedding & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 54 | 0.5757 | 0.755 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.920 | 0.715 | 0.000 | 0.913 | 0.854 | 0.527 |\n| 53 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (Graph Density Tuned) with UMAP | Aether I | 24 | 0.5288 | 0.347 | 0.267 | 0.224 | 0.365 | 0.676 | 0.596 | 0.755 | 0.977 | 0.320 | 0.761 |\n| 47 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (PCA Refined) with UMAP | Aether I | 23 | 0.5255 | 0.329 | 0.261 | 0.215 | 0.368 | 0.643 | 0.592 | 0.794 | 0.976 | 0.301 | 0.778 |\n| 40 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP (Fixed Import) | Aether I | 21 | 0.5011 | 0.296 | 0.268 | 0.211 | 0.336 | 0.655 | 0.577 | 0.628 | 0.969 | 0.307 | 0.764 |\n| 57 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (HVG & K-Neighbors Refined) with UMAP | Aether I | 26 | 0.5011 | 0.296 | 0.268 | 0.211 | 0.336 | 0.655 | 0.577 | 0.628 | 0.969 | 0.307 | 0.764 |\n| 61 | 1 | Combat Correction with Standard Scanpy UMAP | Aether I | 28 | 0.4975 | 0.315 | 0.000 | 0.188 | 0.640 | 0.680 | 0.620 | 0.824 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.713 |\n\
    | 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n| 24 | 1 | Manual BBKNN Batch Integration (Graph Output) | Aether I | 13 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n| 14 | 1 | BBKNN Integration with UMAP Embedding | Aether I | 11 | 0.4086 | 0.415 | 0.000 | 0.020 | 0.508 | 0.890 | 0.649 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.610 |\n| 5 | 1 | Batch-aware UMAP Embedding using Scanpy Neighbors | Aether I | 8 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 36 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP | Aether I | 19 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 163 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication | Aether I | 88 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 202 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Precise) | Aether I | 118 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 310 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication) | Aether\
    \ II | 181 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 312 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Fix Import) | Aether II | 182 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
