    \ | 0.633 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.841 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.645 |\n| 63 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.6: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 28 | 0.6927 | 0.729 | 0.632 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.824 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.644 |\n| 265 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Debugging - Increased Adversarial Weight & Epochs | Sophia II | 158 | 0.6892 | 0.723 | 0.523 | 0.281 | 0.457 | 0.983 | 0.687 | 0.654 | 0.966 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 326 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE Optimization - Increased MMD & KL Weights (mmd=20, kl=2) | Sophia II | 187 | 0.6890 | 0.744 | 0.447 | 0.232 | 0.296 | 0.919 | 0.691 | 0.993 | 0.927 | 0.938 | 0.703 |\n| 133 | 1 | Publication Ablation 1: Lower Gamma (γ=0.65) | Logos I | 68 | 0.6884 | 0.747 | 0.615 | 0.221 | 0.348 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 0.781 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.631 |\n| 62 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.55: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 28 | 0.6868 | 0.730 | 0.630 | 0.225 | 0.305\
