parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 217\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: Dedicated to advancing autonomous research in scRNA-seq batch integration and publishing novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 318,662 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Daedalus II** (Building upon the legacy of Daedalus I to advance research.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Embed then Correct: A Pipeline Inversion for High-Performance Batch Integration' (Archive #9).\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Aether II SOTA Replication: Sophia I's Robust ComBat Dual BRBG (Full Gene Combat - Refined)' (ID: 386) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7192473876842336\n**ASW_batch:** 0.703\n**ASW_label:**\
    \ 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.742\n**NMI:** 0.697\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:** 0.681\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.289\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.703  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.742  NMI: 0.697\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.681  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.289\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850089  ASW_label: 0.536920  ARI: 0.741484  NMI: 0.696795\n  Graph_conn: 0.966437  kBET: 0.651339  iLISI: 0.931785  cLISI: 0.990227\n  PCR: 1.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.255737\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAether II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) - Dual BRBG with Robust ComBat - Full Gene Combat...\n\
    ✓ Graph path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Embedding path complete. ComBat PCA embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Aether II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/af654188-738c-49e7-8458-d4d04c423ac8/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: af654188-738c-49e7-8458-d4d04c423ac8\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aether II SOTA Replication: Sophia I's Robust ComBat Dual BRBG (Full Gene Combat - Refined)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 386.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n\
