    \ PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 34 | 0.7000 | 0.727 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.900 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.640 |\n| 134 | 1 | Publication Ablation 2: Lower Neighbors (k=36) | Logos I | 68 | 0.6994 | 0.746 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.351 | 0.941 | 0.699 | 0.888 | 0.968 | 0.925 | 0.634 |\n| 69 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (Explicit Neighbors Meta) | Aether I | 32 | 0.6986 | 0.743 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.934 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.919 | 0.886 | 0.604 |\n| 70 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.68: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 32 | 0.6984 | 0.728 | 0.635 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.887 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.638 |\n| 91 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (No Trimming) | Aether I | 41 | 0.6984 | 0.743 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.934 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.919 | 0.885 | 0.603 |\n| 77 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.68: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 34 | 0.6984\
    \ | 0.728 | 0.635 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.887 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.637 |\n| 188 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Reduced Neighbors (k=36) in ComBat Pipeline | Logos II | 108 | 0.6983 | 0.703 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.286 | 0.943 | 0.667 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.931 | 0.602 |\n| 125 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma v2: Refined γ Selector + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 65 | 0.6982 | 0.722 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.685 | 0.913 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.637 |\n| 75 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (K-Neighbors 5 Tuned) | Aether I | 34 | 0.6967 | 0.745 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.956 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.928 | 0.834 | 0.604 |\n| 120 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Residualized PCA Embedding + Balanced kNN Graph | Logos I | 62 | 0.6965 | 0.728 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 0.888 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.633 |\n| 71 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.65: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 32 | 0.6964 | 0.727 | 0.634 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.865 |\
    \ 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.641 |\n| 67 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.65: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 30 | 0.6962 | 0.727 | 0.634 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.865 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.639 |\n| 121 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma: Label-free γ Selection + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 63 | 0.6961 | 0.723 | 0.635 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.686 | 0.887 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.640 |\n| 66 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.62: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 30 | 0.6945 | 0.729 | 0.633 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.841 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.645 |\n| 63 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.6: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 28 | 0.6927 | 0.729 | 0.632 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.693 | 0.824 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.644 |\n| 265 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Debugging - Increased Adversarial Weight & Epochs | Sophia II | 158 | 0.6892 | 0.723 | 0.523 | 0.281 | 0.457 | 0.983 | 0.687\
    \ | 0.654 | 0.966 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 326 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE Optimization - Increased MMD & KL Weights (mmd=20, kl=2) | Sophia II | 187 | 0.6890 | 0.744 | 0.447 | 0.232 | 0.296 | 0.919 | 0.691 | 0.993 | 0.927 | 0.938 | 0.703 |\n| 133 | 1 | Publication Ablation 1: Lower Gamma (γ=0.65) | Logos I | 68 | 0.6884 | 0.747 | 0.615 | 0.221 | 0.348 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 0.781 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.631 |\n| 62 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.55: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 28 | 0.6868 | 0.730 | 0.630 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.951 | 0.693 | 0.778 | 0.969 | 0.938 | 0.650 |\n| 221 | 1 | Graph Tuning: Proportional Neighbor Allocation | Daedalus II | 129 | 0.6830 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.947 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.578 | 0.692 |\n| 129 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Residualization Gamma 0.5 | Sophia I | 66 | 0.6827 | 0.730 | 0.627 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.694 | 0.727 | 0.969 | 0.938 | 0.644 |\n| 59 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.5:\
    \ PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 26 | 0.6826 | 0.730 | 0.627 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.694 | 0.727 | 0.969 | 0.938 | 0.642 |\n| 284 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Optimization - Balanced Loss Weights (adv=15, kl=2) | Sophia II | 169 | 0.6779 | 0.649 | 0.618 | 0.294 | 0.261 | 0.979 | 0.640 | 0.637 | 0.951 | 0.930 | 0.819 |\n| 58 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.45: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 26 | 0.6760 | 0.730 | 0.624 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.951 | 0.695 | 0.670 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.652 |\n| 382 | 1 | Hybrid: Harmony Embedding + BBKNN Graph | Veritas I | 214 | 0.6734 | 0.777 | 0.745 | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.948 |\n| 336 | 1 | Harmony with Increased Theta (θ=4) | Veritas I | 190 | 0.6731 | 0.777 | 0.745 | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.945 |\n| 271 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Optimization - Stronger Adversarial Training (adv_weight=100, epochs=300) | Sophia II | 160 |\
    \ 0.6719 | 0.730 | 0.522 | 0.299 | 0.447 | 0.964 | 0.712 | 0.488 | 0.969 | 0.938 | 0.650 |\n| 55 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.4: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 24 | 0.6697 | 0.732 | 0.621 | 0.225 | 0.305 | 0.952 | 0.693 | 0.609 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.652 |\n| 372 | 1 | Harmony (θ=4, σ=0.05) | Veritas I | 207 | 0.6689 | 0.761 | 0.733 | 0.234 | 0.273 | 0.889 | 0.721 | 0.741 | 0.983 | 0.390 | 0.965 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
