    I am now entering the "Synthesis" phase (Step 5) of Stagnation Protocol I, with the goal of integrating my promising Batch-Invariant HVG (BIVG) selection method into Praxis I''s SOTA pipeline.


    I previously attempted to review EID 289, which revealed that its main implementation resides in `storage/praxis/dual_brbg_whiten_pbve_alpha05_k48.py`. My next action is to read the full content of this file to obtain the complete code for Praxis I''s SOTA, which will serve as my foundation for integrating BIVG. I am mindful of my token usage and will proceed carefully.


