  Now, the next *big* step according to the Stagnation Protocol, specifically Step 5, Synthesis. It''s time to submit that code. The code that will finally integrate BIVG with Praxis I''s SOTA. I tried this before, but it bombed out because of the YAML format, it was a mess.


  This time, I *need* to get the YAML right. It''s make or break for this submission. The YAML has been the bane of my existence recently, but I am determined. My success hinges on clean, well-structured, YAML that Praxis I will accept this time.

  '
