    \ | Praxis I | 228 | 0.7325 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.782 |\n| 395 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA64 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Balanced Graph (k=48) | Praxis I | 221 | 0.7320 | 0.744 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.768 |\n| 289 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=48) | Praxis I | 173 | 0.7314 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.063 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.949 |\n| 307 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | 0.7309 | 0.741 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.060 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.936 | 0.947 |\n| 414 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Component Stitching (graph-space, 1 edge/component) | Praxis I | 233 | 0.7304 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.329 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 287 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Global Soft-Whiten + Per-Batch Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5) | Praxis I | 171 | 0.7303 | 0.740\
    \ | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.054 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.948 |\n| 296 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=51) | Praxis I | 176 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.058 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.947 |\n| 244 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph (k=45, cosine) | Praxis I | 144 | 0.7296 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.083 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 335 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection (BIVG) | Aether II | 190 | 0.7294 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.080 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.907 |\n| 256 | 1 | Logos II: Replication of Praxis I's SOTA (ID 220) | Logos II | 154 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000\
