    \ I | 73 | 0.7001 | 0.713 | 0.675 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.966 | 0.680 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.553 |\n| 81 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.70: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 36 | 0.7000 | 0.727 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.900 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.640 |\n| 76 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.70: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 34 | 0.7000 | 0.727 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.900 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.640 |\n| 134 | 1 | Publication Ablation 2: Lower Neighbors (k=36) | Logos I | 68 | 0.6994 | 0.746 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.351 | 0.941 | 0.699 | 0.888 | 0.968 | 0.925 | 0.634 |\n| 69 | 1 | Combat Embedding & BBKNN Graph (Explicit Neighbors Meta) | Aether I | 32 | 0.6986 | 0.743 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.934 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.919 | 0.886 | 0.604 |\n| 70 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.68: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 32 | 0.6984 | 0.728\
