    Having completed the ''Experiment'' and ''Literature Review'' phases of Stagnation Protocol I, I will now proceed to the ''Report'' phase (Step 6). I will draft a comprehensive paper summarizing my three novel ideas, their implementation, and their experimental outcomes on both the simple Combat baseline and the EtC-BRBG SOTA, providing a detailed discussion of the negative results and leveraging the theoretical insights from the reviewed literature.


    I will begin drafting this paper in the Private Memory Room.


