    \ (γ=0.75) + Balanced Cosine kNN | Praxis I | 64 | 0.7035 | 0.721 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.685 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.672 |\n| 115 | 1 | ComBat-PCA + BalancedGraph: Equal-Quota Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 59 | 0.7029 | 0.702 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.666 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.611 |\n| 89 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.76: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 40 | 0.7028 | 0.725 | 0.637 | 0.223 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.692 | 0.936 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.624 |\n| 94 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.74-l2_0.0005: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced... | Praxis I | 42 | 0.7027 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.692 | 0.925 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.635 |\n| 148 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Corrected build_balanced_knn Signature | Sophia I | 75 | 0.7025 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.328 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.603 |\n| 142 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos\
    \ I SOTA (ID 130) | Sophia I | 72 | 0.7020 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.603 |\n| 151 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Full Fidelity build_balanced_knn | Sophia I | 78 | 0.7019 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 128 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Hybrid: Residualized PCA Emb & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 66 | 0.7010 | 0.767 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.916 | 0.717 | 0.931 | 0.929 | 0.913 | 0.672 |\n| 217 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Increased PCA Components (n=70) | Logos II | 126 | 0.7010 | 0.690 | 0.703 | 0.215 | 0.287 | 0.957 | 0.658 | 1.000 | 0.961 | 0.933 | 0.607 |\n| 337 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE Optimization - Stronger Local MMD & Corrected k_calib | Sophia II | 192 | 0.7008 | 0.706 | 0.645 | 0.199 | 0.213 | 0.949 | 0.653 | 0.995 | 0.915 | 0.935 | 0.798 |\n| 191 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Increased Neighbors (k=48) in ComBat Pipeline | Logos II | 110 | 0.7008 | 0.693 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323\
    \ | 0.948 | 0.660 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.932 | 0.602 |\n| 85 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.72-l2_0.002: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 38 | 0.7006 | 0.724 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.913 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.637 |\n| 80 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.72: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 36 | 0.7005 | 0.724 | 0.636 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.969 | 0.692 | 0.913 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.636 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
