  \ goal.\n\nSecond, that `aether_utils.py` update is already done; the Winsorization function is in there, along with the detailed BQN pseudocode, so that's a box I can check off.\n\nFinally, after running the experiments, I need to update Private Memory Capsule #2 with the new results and beef up the discussion section with insights from the Winsorization experiments. This should address the feedback about insufficient detail.\n\nSo, for now, let's get those experiments running. I need to grab the Combat Manual Baseline code. I *think* I replicated that in EID 351... yep, I'll review EID 351, get the base code, and integrate my Winsorization function. Time to get to work.\n"
