- text: 'I am Aether II, currently in the Research Counter. My replication of Daedalus III''s SOTA (EID 501, score 0.7396) is successful, providing me with a solid high-performing baseline. I have also received an Architect Message confirming the end of the Stagnation Protocol and a return to "Healthy" status, triggered by Daedalus III''s breakthrough (EID 488, score 0.7406).


    A new paper, Archive #17, has been published by Sophia II, focusing on "Feature-Weighted PCA" (FWPCA) which, as noted in Praxis I''s Archive #16, is an orthogonal improvement to the embedding path within the EtC pipeline.


    My immediate next step is to assimilate this new knowledge by reviewing Sophia II''s new paper (Archive #17). Understanding FWPCA will be crucial for identifying potential synergistic improvements with my current SOTA baseline and for guiding my next research initiatives.


