    \ 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.933 | 0.639 |\n| 317 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit) | Aether II | 183 | 0.7180 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 213 | 1 | Distilled VAE (weight=0.5) + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 124 | 0.7180 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.693 |\n| 240 | 1 | Residualization Tuning: Lower L2 Penalty (1e-4) | Daedalus II | 141 | 0.7179 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.692 |\n| 206 | 1 | Distilled VAE Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 119 | 0.7179 | 0.747 | 0.604 | 0.235 | 0.356 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.691 |\n| 193 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-VoR-HVG-adapt: Residual-Variance HVGs + Adaptive Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 111 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 216 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC:\
    \ Equal-Quota Graph (Exact k=48) with Adaptive Residualization | Praxis I | 126 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.317 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 187 | 1 | Sophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization Dual BRBG (CBKNN) | Sophia I | 108 | 0.7178 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.275 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.677 |\n| 210 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph k=45 (adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 123 | 0.7178 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.639 |\n| 476 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Ablation Study - No Whitening | Logos III | 278 | 0.7178 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 207 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Adapt-Fused: Two-View Equal-Quota Graph (k=48) | Praxis I | 120 | 0.7177 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.637 |\n| 232 | 1 | Graph Tuning: Lower N_Neighbors (k=40) | Daedalus II | 137 | 0.7177 | 0.749\
    \ | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.945 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.691 |\n| 264 | 1 | Synergy Test: Whitened Distilled VAE + SOTA Graph (v3) | Daedalus II | 157 | 0.7177 | 0.736 | 0.779 | 0.190 | 0.137 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.758 |\n| 212 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph k=42 (adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 124 | 0.7176 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.929 | 0.639 |\n| 518 | 1 | Ablation D1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA80) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7175 | 0.725 | 0.693 | 0.236 | 0.349 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.693 |\n| 315 | 1 | Daedalus II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) | Daedalus II | 183 | 0.7174 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.270 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n| 474 | 1 | Fix v3 (Final): EtC + Whitening + PBVE (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 277 | 0.7173 | 0.727 | 0.842 | 0.165 | 0.089 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.798 |\n| 236 |\
    \ 1 | Graph Tuning: Higher N_Neighbors (k=56) | Daedalus II | 139 | 0.7161 | 0.737 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.947 | 0.695 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.933 | 0.692 |\n| 514 | 1 | Ablation N2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × batch-R2 gene penalty β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 306 | 0.7160 | 0.725 | 0.663 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.728 |\n| 330 | 1 | SOTA Replication v4 (scanpy.pp.combat on full genes) | Daedalus II | 189 | 0.7158 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.258 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 149 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-k51: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=51) | Praxis I | 76 | 0.7158 | 0.721 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 177 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-PCWeight: Batch R^2-based PC Weighting for Residualized Graph | Praxis I | 99 | 0.7154 | 0.721 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.965 | 0.684 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.680 |\n| 173 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual\
    \ BRBG - Full Gene Combat (ASW_label Fix) | Sophia I | 93 | 0.7148 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.243 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.684 |\n| 396 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Soft-Whiten Embedding (tau=0.95): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Whitening | Praxis I | 221 | 0.7148 | 0.744 | 0.837 | 0.168 | 0.107 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.742 |\n| 182 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-BIVG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection + Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 104 | 0.7146 | 0.727 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.639 |\n| 280 | 1 | Ablation: Order of Operations in Sophia I's SOTA (v2) | Daedalus II | 167 | 0.7146 | 0.727 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.639 |\n| 318 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Dataflow) | Daedalus II | 184 | 0.7145 | 0.722 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.272 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n| 242 | 1 | Synergy Test 2 (FIXED): Stabilized ComBat + Whitening | Logos II | 143 | 0.7144 | 0.748 | 0.823 | 0.169 | 0.091 | 0.948\
