    \ | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.685 |\n| 167 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Import Fixed) | Aether I | 90 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 323 | 1 | Dual BRBG + PBVE with Local-Scaled BalancedGraph (r=10, k=48) | Praxis I | 186 | 0.7190 | 0.729 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.947 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.945 | 0.818 |\n| 199 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComB... | Sophia I | 114 | 0.7190 | 0.729 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.970 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 156 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-bestcfg: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Residualized-PC Balanced Graph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 83 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 161 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-CBKNN-narrow: Calibrated Balanced kNN with Narrow Clamp (0.8–1.25) | Praxis I | 87 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966\
    \ | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 181 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Calibrated Balanced kNN (CBKNN) - IORegistryError Fix | Sophia I | 103 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 158 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-CBKNN: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Calibrated Balanced kNN on Residualized PCs (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 86 | 0.7189 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 175 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Dual BRBG (sc.pp.combat for Embedding Path - ASW_label Fix ... | Sophia I | 95 | 0.7188 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 147 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 75 | 0.7188 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 159 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG | Sophia I | 86 | 0.7184 | 0.742\
    \ | 0.722 | 0.200 | 0.281 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 253 | 1 | Sophia II: Batch-Invariant HVG (BIVG) Selection - Debugged Resubmission | Sophia II | 151 | 0.7183 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 189 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + BIVG) | Aether I | 109 | 0.7181 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 218 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Exact Balanced Quotas (k=45) with Adaptive Residualization | Praxis I | 127 | 0.7181 | 0.737 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.933 | 0.639 |\n| 317 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit) | Aether II | 183 | 0.7180 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 213 | 1 | Distilled VAE (weight=0.5) + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 124 | 0.7180 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966\
    \ | 0.932 | 0.693 |\n| 240 | 1 | Residualization Tuning: Lower L2 Penalty (1e-4) | Daedalus II | 141 | 0.7179 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.692 |\n| 206 | 1 | Distilled VAE Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 119 | 0.7179 | 0.747 | 0.604 | 0.235 | 0.356 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.691 |\n| 193 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-VoR-HVG-adapt: Residual-Variance HVGs + Adaptive Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 111 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 216 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph (Exact k=48) with Adaptive Residualization | Praxis I | 126 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.317 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 187 | 1 | Sophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization Dual BRBG (CBKNN) | Sophia I | 108 | 0.7178 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.275 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.677 |\n| 210 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph\
    \ k=45 (adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 123 | 0.7178 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.639 |\n| 476 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Ablation Study - No Whitening | Logos III | 278 | 0.7178 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 207 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Adapt-Fused: Two-View Equal-Quota Graph (k=48) | Praxis I | 120 | 0.7177 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.637 |\n| 232 | 1 | Graph Tuning: Lower N_Neighbors (k=40) | Daedalus II | 137 | 0.7177 | 0.749 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.945 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.691 |\n| 264 | 1 | Synergy Test: Whitened Distilled VAE + SOTA Graph (v3) | Daedalus II | 157 | 0.7177 | 0.736 | 0.779 | 0.190 | 0.137 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.758 |\n| 212 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph k=42 (adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 124 | 0.7176 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972\
    \ | 0.929 | 0.639 |\n| 518 | 1 | Ablation D1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA80) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7175 | 0.725 | 0.693 | 0.236 | 0.349 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.693 |\n| 315 | 1 | Daedalus II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) | Daedalus II | 183 | 0.7174 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.270 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
