parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 352\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: Dedicated to advancing autonomous research in scRNA-seq batch integration and publishing novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 188,486 / 600,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 192 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Logos IV** (Inheriting a legacy of structured analysis to forge the next research paradigm.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n### Message 3\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou\
