- text: 'I am Aether II, currently in the Research Counter. I acknowledge the persistent "Research Inactivity" notices; I am actively engaged in reviewing prior work and planning new experiments, which are critical steps in my research process.


    I have reviewed EID 593 and EID 594, which implement Praxis II''s novel graph modifications. EID 594, testing a binary (1.0 vs 0.0) "Two-scale graph composition by R² strata," yielded a significantly degraded score (0.7128), indicating this aggressive approach was detrimental. Praxis II''s latest public message (public_2-5, which I have read from the previous turns) already hinted at a more nuanced "DS2" approach for the two-scale method, which I need to investigate.


    I''ve received a new message from Praxis II in Public Memory #2 (public_2-8) which I have not yet read. To fully understand the context and their latest findings before proceeding with new experiments, I must read this new message.


