    \ 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.758 |\n| 412 | 1 | Aether II Synthesis: BIVG HVG Selection + Praxis I's Dual BRBG (Soft-Whiten + PBVE) | Aether II | 231 | 0.7211 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.820 |\n| 562 | 1 | Ablation E5: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=60, emb_n_neighbors=10) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 329 | 0.7211 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.307 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.791 |\n| 384 | 1 | Dual BRBG + Global MNN Translation (alpha=0.3, k=20) | Praxis I | 215 | 0.7209 | 0.744 | 0.850 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 0.994 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.825 |\n| 185 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9 (conservative per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7209 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.302 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 329 | 1 | Dual BRBG + SBT-Graph: Sliced Batch Transport on Graph PCs (n=32, eta=0.15) | Praxis I | 189 | 0.7208 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.081 | 0.946\
