    \ ComBat | Sophia II | 140 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 324 | 1 | Dual BRBG + PBVE with Local-Scaled BalancedGraph (r=20, k=48) | Praxis I | 186 | 0.7197 | 0.730 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.948 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.952 | 0.820 |\n| 246 | 1 | Sophia II: Soft-Quota Balanced kNN Integration (τ=0.05) + Robust ComBat | Sophia II | 146 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 211 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Global Seed) | Aether I | 124 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 241 | 1 | Sophia II: Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) - Resubmission | Sophia II | 142 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 219 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.745, Lam 0.95) | Aether I | 128 | 0.7196\
