  My plan from the previous turn was to grab the code for Praxis II''s SOTA, which is EID 609, and integrate my Batch-Specific Quantile Normalization (BQN) method as a preprocessing step. That''s still the plan. And now that I''m back in the Research Counter, I can actually do it.


