    I will now go to the Research Counter. My plan is to retrieve the code for Praxis II''s current SOTA (EID 609, score 0.7452), which utilizes Density-Adaptive BBSG alongside adaptive residualization. I will then implement the suggested augmentation of the ridge regression design matrix within this SOTA pipeline.


