    \ | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.890 |\n| 473 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Test with Stabilized ComBat (v2, Corrected) | Logos III | 277 | 0.7260 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.873 |\n| 543 | 1 | Ablation GW1: BRBG + BBSG with graph PC weights w_j=(1−R2_j)^0.5 | Praxis II | 318 | 0.7259 | 0.739 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.948 | 0.897 | 0.789 |\n| 263 | 1 | Synergy Test 3 (FIXED): Praxis SOTA + Logos's Stabilized ComBat | Logos II | 157 | 0.7259 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.872 |\n| 285 | 1 | Linear Synthesis: Sophia's Preprocessing + Praxis's Post-processing | Daedalus II | 170 | 0.7258 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.872 |\n| 237 | 1 | Synergy Test: Sophia's Full-Gene ComBat + Praxis's Whitening | Logos II | 140 | 0.7258 | 0.742 | 0.844 | 0.153 | 0.054 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.904 |\n| 283 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Two-Scale\
    \ Quotas (k2=2 stitches per other batch) | Praxis I | 168 | 0.7257 | 0.732 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.056 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.890 |\n| 225 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.85) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 132 | 0.7256 | 0.736 | 0.835 | 0.169 | 0.098 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.843 |\n| 227 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.9) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 133 | 0.7256 | 0.736 | 0.837 | 0.165 | 0.091 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.852 |\n| 222 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + Whitening) | Aether I | 130 | 0.7256 | 0.732 | 0.844 | 0.153 | 0.054 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.899 |\n| 448 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: n_clusters=64, gamma_max=0.7 (k=48) | Praxis I | 261 | 0.7255 | 0.721 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.327 | 0.958 | 0.671 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 308 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE Auto-Gated PCs (τ=80th) + Balanced kNN (k=48)\
    \ | Praxis I | 181 | 0.7255 | 0.740 | 0.847 | 0.156 | 0.064 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.899 |\n| 274 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Axis Reweighting β=0.75 (k=45) | Praxis I | 162 | 0.7254 | 0.732 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.053 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.891 |\n| 333 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.5): Stronger CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | 0.7253 | 0.743 | 0.857 | 0.159 | 0.076 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.867 |\n| 276 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Batch-Center Recenter η=0.05 (k=45) | Praxis I | 165 | 0.7251 | 0.732 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.060 | 0.962 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.941 | 0.892 |\n| 466 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BM-PCA(λc=1.0): Per-Batch Mean Centering before Graph PCA | Praxis I | 273 | 0.7245 | 0.719 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.322 | 0.947 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.781 |\n| 259 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Sublinear Residualization p=0.50 (k=45) | Praxis I | 156 | 0.7245 | 0.728 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.061 | 0.962 | 0.692 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.971 | 0.939 | 0.891 |\n| 442 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: Cluster-Conditional Residualized Graph (k=48, n_clusters=64) — Path Fix | Praxis I | 255 | 0.7244 | 0.719 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.319 | 0.958 | 0.670 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 332 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.3): Per-Batch CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | 0.7244 | 0.744 | 0.859 | 0.159 | 0.062 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.870 |\n| 247 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph (k=45, euclidean) | Praxis I | 147 | 0.7244 | 0.714 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.952 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.952 | 0.906 |\n| 258 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Sublinear Residualization p=0.75 (k=45) | Praxis I | 156 | 0.7243 | 0.730 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.054 | 0.963 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.891 |\n| 277 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Batch-Center Recenter η=0.10 (k=45) | Praxis I | 165 | 0.7240 | 0.731 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.061 | 0.951 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.891 |\n\
    | 295 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.55, k=48) | Praxis I | 176 | 0.7238 | 0.740 | 0.858 | 0.157 | 0.066 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.870 |\n| 567 | 1 | Praxis default (repro) — EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA60→ComBat) + BRBG(lam=0.9, γ_max=0.74, PCA50) + BBSG... | Praxis II | 334 | 0.7237 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.336 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.788 |\n| 451 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: n_clusters=96, gamma_max=0.6 (k=48) | Praxis I | 263 | 0.7231 | 0.724 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.289 | 0.959 | 0.682 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.935 | 0.778 |\n| 509 | 1 | Ablation R2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.8) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 303 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.952 | 0.896 | 0.789 |\n| 255 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: PCA72 (tau=0.95, k=45, AdaptPC) | Praxis I | 153 | 0.7229 | 0.732 | 0.848 | 0.152 | 0.051 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.941 | 0.868 |\n| 508 | 1 | Ablation R1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.7)\
    \ + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 302 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 571 | 1 | Praxis default (distance-repaired) — Recompute true BBSG distances for LISI | Praxis II | 336 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 529 | 1 | Ablation Gmax72: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(gamma_max=0.72, lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 559 | 1 | Ablation E4: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=60, emb_n_neighbors=20) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 328 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 510 | 1 | Ablation R3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.85) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 304 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.789 |\n| 556 | 1 | Ablation E3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=60, emb_n_neighbors=30) +\
    \ BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 327 | 0.7228 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.788 |\n| 538 | 1 | Ablation K1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) with k=51 | Praxis II | 316 | 0.7226 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.325 | 0.957 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.950 | 0.898 | 0.790 |\n| 341 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten (tau=0.96) + PBVE 0.5, k=48 | Praxis I | 194 | 0.7226 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.160 | 0.085 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.834 |\n| 314 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PBVE 0.5 with Mean-Shift HVG Pruning (q=2%, k=48) | Praxis I | 183 | 0.7224 | 0.741 | 0.855 | 0.160 | 0.066 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.855 |\n| 506 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Higher Embedding Dimensionality (n_comps=70) | Daedalus III | 300 | 0.7222 | 0.738 | 0.700 | 0.214 | 0.349 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.641 |\n| 617 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.1 - BBSG-Only Graph (FWPCA Embed + BBSG Graph) | Sophia II | 370 | 0.7222\
    \ | 0.729 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.963 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.891 | 0.746 |\n| 596 | 1 | BRBG + Density-Adaptive BBSG (±10% cross-batch quotas; ablation) | Praxis II | 357 | 0.7221 | 0.664 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.671 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 620 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.2 - BBSG Sensitivity (FWPCA Embed + BBSG alpha=0.5 Graph) | Sophia II | 372 | 0.7221 | 0.729 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.964 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.891 | 0.746 |\n| 582 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7221 | 0.725 | 0.657 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.792 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer\
