    \ III | 318 | 0.7389 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.424 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 612 | 1 | Logos IV: SOTA Hyperparameter Sweep (k_total=64) | Logos IV | 367 | 0.7388 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.480 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.794 |\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 611 | 1 | Logos IV: SOTA Hyperparameter Sweep (k_total=32) | Logos IV | 367 | 0.7382 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.474 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.794 |\n| 475 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) (alpha_weight=1.0) | Sophia II | 278 | 0.7371 | 0.736 | 0.680 | 0.219 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.806 |\n| 648 | 1 | Cellwise adaptive shrinkage β=1.0 with DAQB (δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 389 | 0.7369 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.356 | 0.946 | 0.710\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.793 |\n| 607 | 1 | Logos IV: Hypothesis - Exact Balanced kNN Graph | Logos IV | 365 | 0.7368 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.795 |\n| 619 | 1 | Logos IV: Ablation Study - SOTA without Refinement (alpha=0) | Logos IV | 370 | 0.7366 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.793 |\n| 600 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15): Synergy Test | Praxis II | 359 | 0.7365 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.791 |\n| 495 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) (alpha_weight=1.5) | Sophia II | 291 | 0.7364 | 0.736 | 0.680 | 0.218 | 0.334 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.818 |\n| 485 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 465 | 1 | EtC-BRBG\
