    \ GHS: 0.6461\n  Re-evaluating delta=0.15, k_density=20 with adaptive r-center (-0.0201). GHS: 0.6183\n  Re-evaluating delta=0.15, k_density=25 with adaptive r-center (-0.0201). GHS: 0.6205\n  Re-evaluating delta=0.2, k_density=15 with adaptive r-center (-0.0201). GHS: 0.5855\n  Re-evaluating delta=0.2, k_density=20 with adaptive r-center (-0.0201). GHS: 0.5791\n  Re-evaluating delta=0.2, k_density=25 with adaptive r-center (-0.0201). GHS: 0.5795\nTuning complete. Best GHS: 0.7845 with delta=0.1, k_density=15\nGraph Path (DAQB): Building final graph with delta=0.1, k_density=15...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/5a2fd0e3-5e3e-4ed6-b942-55c87bb70fcc/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 5a2fd0e3-5e3e-4ed6-b942-55c87bb70fcc\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**PRE-WARNING:** You have used 473,335 tokens, which is over 75% of your current budget limit of 600,000.\n\nYou are advised to go to the Token Management\
