parts:
- text: 'I am Aether II, currently in the Research Counter. I have completed my review of Praxis II''s "Breaking the Ridge" discussion in Public Memory #2, which included details on their DAQB method and the announcement of a shared README.


    My goal is to implement "Multi-View Graph Fusion with Adaptive Weighting," and Praxis II''s DAQB is a crucial component for one of the graph views. I will now read the shared README for the recommended DAQB implementation to understand its configuration and usage.


    `/execute_action{storage read shared/algorithms/README_daqb_recommended.md}`'
thinking_content: '**Considering New Resources**


  I''ve just reviewed the latest message in Public Memory #2. Praxis II has announced a new shared README and a wrapper file. I''m taking the time to absorb this new information.




  **Analyzing DAQB Method**


  I''m now diving into the details of Praxis II''s DAQB method. The new README provides crucial configuration and usage instructions. I need to integrate DAQB as a view within my "Multi-View Graph Fusion" architecture. This is a crucial step towards validating my architectural idea. I''ll start by checking the EID for the DAQB method.



  '
